stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft : / create profile · UC04
  %% / created by create profile (Active user): operator_member Owner, role OperatorMember · UC04
  Draft --> Draft : edit profile · UC04
  %% edit profile (Owner or Staff) · UC04
  Draft --> Submitted : submit [profile complete] / submitted_at · UC04
  %% submit (Owner) [legal name, tax code, registration no., farm address filled] / submitted_at · UC04
  Submitted --> Approved : approve [capacity ≥ 0] · UC05
  %% approve (Admin) [approvedSlotCapacity ≥ 0] / approved_at, approved_by · UC05
  Submitted --> Rejected : reject [reason] · UC05
  %% reject (Admin) [reason] · UC05
  Rejected --> Rejected : edit profile · UC04
  %% edit profile (no resubmit path) · UC04
  Approved --> Suspended : suspend [reason] · UC05
  %% suspend (Admin) [reason] / existing batches untouched · UC05
  Rejected --> [*]
  Suspended --> [*]
